SUMMARY:Impromptu - MM Round the River (65VH)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nSweep: open\n\nAverage Pa
 ce 14-15 mph\n\nThis ride has no Ride with GPS file. Join me to create one
  by riding it.\nCue Sheet: [Old School Cue Sheet](https://routes.lancaster
 bikeclub.net/cue/mm-around-the-river-south-65vh/)\n\nThis is a long challe
 nging ride. We will make stops where available\, but it is a very rural ar
 ea. Please bring two water bottles and pocket nutrition for on the bike.\n
 \nAfter the ride for a beverage or food. [Loxley's](http://www.heritagelan
 caster.com/restaurant)\n\nRide leader will ride at the advertised average 
 speed\, unless at the back. This is intended to be a no-drop group ride. Y
 ou can ride ahead if you want to.\n\nHelmets are mandatory\; please also p
 lan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire l
 evers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nBeing a Meetup Member does not mean you are a
  club member. Use this [link to join](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/co
 ntent.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148) the club.\nYour RSVP is your agreeme
 nt to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpre
 ss.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) and [Rules
  of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22
 &club_id=257148&module_id=325159)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3144888
 90/
