SUMMARY:B/B+ Old Trolley Line to Manheim Loop (47R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride leader: Gavin Robe
 rtson**\n\n**Anticipated Average Pace: 16-19 mph**\n\n**Route: [https://ri
 dewithgps.com/routes/54840086](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/54840086)**\
 n\nThis is a B/B+ level ride. The ride leader will ride at the advertised 
 average speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as 
 the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group toge
 ther with occasional regroupings and a sweeper may also be appointed at th
 e start.\nPlease do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with
  the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself
  and encouraged to join a faster group. If maintaining a 16-19 mph average
  is beyond your current ability level\, please consider joining a slower r
 ide first.\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a ba
 sic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nTo elimina
 te passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership 
 and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you
  are a club member.\nJoin here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikecl
 ub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreemen
 t to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.la
 ncasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nGuidance if a
 n incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/conten
 t.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3145017
 09/
